    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a massive battlefield where two teams clash over resources, strategy, and firepower. Start as infantry, pilot hover tanks or flying pods, and unleash laser-based combat in a sci-fi warzone reminiscent of classic space battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Team Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two teams battle across a sprawling landscape. Coordinate with allies, defend your base, or go on the offensive to destroy the enemy core.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meteor Impact Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each match, a meteor crashes into the battlefield. Both teams race to the impact site, fight off enemy AI defenders, and mine precious Gravitium.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mining &amp; Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Gravitium from meteor sites and use it to purchase powerful upgrades: wall turrets, proximity mines, new weapons, and attribute boosts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicle Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly transition between on-foot combat and high-speed hover tanks or flying pods. Take control of the battlefield from land or air.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Futuristic Laser Weaponry</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage enemies with vibrant, sci-fi-inspired laser rifles, sniper weapons, and explosive grenade launchers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base Defense &amp; Siege</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your base with automated defenses and traps while plotting an assault on the enemy core. Fortify your stronghold and prepare for all-out sieges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Combatants</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy AI guards protect critical areas and resources, adding another layer of challenge and excitement to each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for intense sci-fi warfare where strategy, teamwork, and firepower decide the fate of the battlefield. Will your team destroy the enemy core and claim victory?</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enter a massive battlefield where two teams clash over resources, strategy, and firepower. Start as infantry, pilot hover tanks or flying pods, and unleash laser-based combat in a sci-fi warzone reminiscent of classic space battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dynamic Team Warfare</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Two teams battle across a sprawling landscape. Coordinate with allies, defend your base, or go on the offensive to destroy the enemy core.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meteor Impact Events</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >At the start of each match, a meteor crashes into the battlefield. Both teams race to the impact site, fight off enemy AI defenders, and mine precious Gravitium.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Mining &amp; Upgrades</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Gravitium from meteor sites and use it to purchase powerful upgrades: wall turrets, proximity mines, new weapons, and attribute boosts.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Vehicle Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Seamlessly transition between on-foot combat and high-speed hover tanks or flying pods. Take control of the battlefield from land or air.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Futuristic Laser Weaponry</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Engage enemies with vibrant, sci-fi-inspired laser rifles, sniper weapons, and explosive grenade launchers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Base Defense &amp; Siege</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your base with automated defenses and traps while plotting an assault on the enemy core. Fortify your stronghold and prepare for all-out sieges.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >AI Combatants</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enemy AI guards protect critical areas and resources, adding another layer of challenge and excitement to each battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Prepare for intense sci-fi warfare where strategy, teamwork, and firepower decide the fate of the battlefield. Will your team destroy the enemy core and claim victory?</p>",
